#
#  时间段从每天0:00开始
#
#  Note the length of a phase is in minutes of a day.
#

# The two lines defines the data format in 2 lines as
#
#  field1:field2:field3....
#  format1:format2:format3....
#

length:time_msg:desc_msg:event_fun
